At infinity the specific energy is $v^2/2$ and $l=bv$, so
$$e=\sqrt{1+\frac{b^2v^4}{k^2}}.$$
The angle through which the <velocity> is deflected between the incoming and outgoing asymptotes is
$$\chi=2\tan^{-1}\left(\frac{k}{bv^2}\right).$$

